# Route: guide 46 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Gnome (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 58 to 60, 73
# quests, 3.8 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Eastern Plaguelands, Arathi Highlands, Ironforge, Stormwind City,
# Teldrassil, Duskwood, Swamp of Sorrows, Westfall, Dun Morogh, Burning
# Steppes, Stonetalon Mountains): Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Darrowshire -> Refuge
# Pointe -> Circle of West Binding -> Thandol Span -> Faldir's Cove ->
# Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> near Stormwind City -> near
# Stormwind -> Stormwind City -> near Stormwind City -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Summoning the Princess (656;
# Myzrael 44); Save Techbot's Brain! (2922; Techbot 26); An Ambassador of Evil
# (762; Ambassador Infernus 42); Oakenscowl (2499; Oakenscowl 9); Morbent Fel
# (55; Morbent Fel 32).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The
# Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243),
# The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless Souls (5282),
# Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Dead Man's Plea (8945),
# Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the
# Deeps (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050),
# The Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the
# Necklace (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924),
